    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE\nAPRIL 1, 1981\nPIEDMONT\nAIRLINES\nQUICK REFERENCE SCHEDULE\nCHICAGO\nFor reservations and information in Chicago,\ncall 263-3656.\nFor Air Cargo, call 686-4690.\nNew round-trip direct service to Kinston.\nFly our convenient nonstops to Charlotte,\nGreensboro, and Richmond.\nLV\nMeal LV\nAp\nAr\nTo Asheville, N. C.\nS\n950a 0\n133p\nL 1020a 0\n254p\nS\n400p 0\n729p\nD 559p0\n943p\nTo Atlanta, Ga.\n950a 0\nS 10 30a 0\nS 1230p 0\nS\n400p 0\n559p 0\n240p\n350p\n505p\n835p\n1055p\nAp\nFlight No.\n316/284\n222/237\n230\n336/273\n316/284\n300/53\n268\n230\n336/289\nFreq.\nVia/\nStops\nCLT\nGSO\n1\nCLT\nCLT\nCRW\nCLT\nTo Baltimore, Md.\nS 950a0\n300p\nL 1020a 0\n415p\nTo Beckley, W. Va.\n925a 0\n137p\n316/308\n222/204\n302/905\nCLT\nGSO\nROA\nTo Boston, Mass.\nL 1020a 0\n534p\nS 240p0\n659p\n222/311\n392\nGSO\nMeal Lv\nAp\nAr\nAr\nAp Flight No.\nFrom Asheville, N. C.\nB\n710a\n8 45a 0\nS\n220p\n355p 0\nS\n405p\n605p 0\n325\n285/341\n927/309\nFrom Atlanta, Ga\nS\n620a\n640a\n9 33a 0\n10 00a 0\nco co\n915a\n1137a 0\n950a\n123700\nS 1110a\n308p 0\nS 1220p\n355p 0\nS\n300p\n605p 0\n219\n200/609\n206/275\n389\n217\n330/341\n288/309\nFrom Baltimore, Md\nContact Piedmont Airlines\nFrom Beckley, W. Va.\nS 745a\n933a 0\nS\n931a\n1137a0\n220p\n605p0\nFrom Boston, Mass.\nS\n700a\n143p 0\nS 1025a\n3 08p 0\nL 1100a\n355p 0\nS 1200p\n605p 0\n930/219\n951/275\n932/309\n343/391\n361/217\n327/341\n311/309\nFreq\nVia\nStops\nCLT\nTRI\nTRI\nCRW\n2\n3\nCLT\nTRI\nX7\nROA\nCRW\nROA\nEWR\nGSO\nCLT\nEWR",
      "Introducing\nFlight\nPay For\nPassengers.\nWith our Hopscotch ™ Fare, we\ncharge you a lot less money for spend-\ning a little more time with us.\nThis fare is valid on your Piedmont\nflight that makes one or more stops,\nor a connection, in selected markets.\nSave 50% round trip.*\nIf you fly one way, we take 30% off.\nSo, either way, you get good flight\npay. Call your travel agent or us for\ndetails on how you can get our\nHopscotch ™ Fare. But do it soon.\nWitha deal this good, seats are limited.\nPiedmont's\n50%-Off Fares\n*Round-trip service not always available.\nAll fares subject to change without notice\nFREQUENCY\n1—Monday\n5—Friday\n2-Tuesday\n6Saturday\n3Wednesday\n7—Sunday\n4-Thursday\nX-Except\nSYMBOLS\nMEAL SERVICE\nB-Breakfast\nL-Lunch\nD-Dinner\nS-Snack\nAIRPORTS\nG-Greensboro/N-Newark Int'l\nHigh Point\n0—O'Hare Int'l\nL-La Guardia W-Winston-Salem\nAll Washington, D.C. Flights\nArrive/Depart National Airport\nAll schedules in local time. Schedules subject to change without notice. For\nadditional schedule information call us.\n2015.126.06)"
